<p class="basic-info-title" style="color: #a91a2d;">Information</p>
<div class="m-t-10 m-b-10 nop locked-text"><span class="am am-pin" style="margin-right: 10px;"></span> <a href="https://www.google.it/maps/place/Palazzo+Schifanoia/@44.8304687,11.6265053,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x477e4e44778284c9:0x7587ac7c5b9aba5c!8m2!3d44.8304649!4d11.6290802!16zL20vMGI1Z2t5?entry=ttu" target="_blank" style="font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; color: #000;" title="Vedi su Maps"> <span style="text-decoration: underline;" class="m-r-5"> <span><strong><span class="street-address">Via Scandiana, 23</span>, <span class="postal-code">44121</span> <span class="locality">Ferrara</span> <span class="region">FE</span>, <span class="country-name">Italy</span></strong></span> <span class="am am-open-in-new"> </span> </span></a></div>
<div class="m-t-10 m-b-10 nop"><span class="am am-phone" style="margin-right: 10px;"></span> <strong>+39 0532 244949</strong></div>
<div class="m-t-10 m-b-10 nop">
<div class="info-accordion"><span class="am am-calendar-check" style="margin-right: 10px;"></span> <span class="accordion" onclick="$(this).next().next().slideToggle(); $(this).next().toggleClass('am-chevron-up')"><strong>Opening time</strong></span> <span class="accrodion-chevron am am-chevron-down" style="margin-left: 10px;" onclick="$(this).next().slideToggle();"></span>
<div class="accordion-content" style="display: none;">
<p><strong>Tuesday to Sunday</strong>, 10 am to 7 pm<br />Ticket office closes at 6 pm</p>
<p><em>Aforementioned are standard museum hours. For all updates regarding any changes in hours and opening days click&nbsp;<a href="https://www.ferrarainfo.com/en/where-to-go/city-and-territory/ferrara/museums-and-monuments-of-ferrara/museo-schifanoia-and-museo-lapidario" target="_blank"><strong><span style="background-color: #800000; color: #ffffff;"> &nbsp;HERE&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></strong></a></em></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="m-t-10 m-b-10 nop">
<div class="info-accordion"><span class="am am-ticket-star" style="margin-right: 10px;"></span> <span class="accordion" onclick="$(this).next().next().slideToggle(); $(this).next().toggleClass('am-chevron-up')"><strong>Tickets and accessibility</strong></span> <span class="accrodion-chevron am am-chevron-down" style="margin-left: 10px;" onclick="$(this).next().slideToggle();"></span>
<div class="accordion-content" style="display: none;">
<p><span style="color: #800000;"><strong>Tickets</strong></span></p>
<p>Online reservation at <a href="https://preventweb.cloud:7456/PreventOnline" target="_blank">https://preventweb.cloud:7456/PreventOnline</a>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Full ticket:</strong> &euro; 12&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Reduced ticket:</strong> &euro; 9&nbsp;</p>
<p>18 to 30-year-olds<br />over 65-year-olds<br />YougER cardholders<br />university students enrolled in their first year at the University of Ferrara who show their admission ticket<br />other affiliated categories<br />&nbsp;<br /><strong>Free admission:</strong></p>
<p>school groups with accompanying teachers<br />children below 18<br />disabled people with accompanying person<br />tour guides with badges<br />journalists and publicists with card<br /><a href="https://www.ferraraterraeacqua.it/it/myfecard/cose-myfe-card" target="_blank">MyFE Card</a> holders<br />people celebrating their birthday on visit day<br />18 App<br />&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong><span style="color: #800000;">Accessibility</span></strong></p>
<p>Wheelchair accessible.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
